      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The creek rises three miles northwest of Leander, flows east for sixty‑nine miles, and empties into the San Gabriel River near Rockdale.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
